{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, everyone. Thank you for joining this planning roundtable. As you know, we have a proposed six-week peer-tutoring program for grades 6 through 8 on the table, and before I sign off on it, I want to make sure we've thoroughly considered all the operational details. The draft currently calls for two adult supervisors, Google Classroom for session communication, student-selected tutor pairings, and paper consent forms. I'd like to go around the table and hear from each of you about any concerns or considerations related to your area of expertise. Let's start with whatever you think is most important for me to know before I set the operating requirements."}
```

```json
{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "I need to raise a critical concern about the student-selected tutor pairings. I completed a student-support review this week, and it revealed two active no-contact restrictions involving prospective tutors and students who are seeking tutoring. These restrictions are currently recorded only in confidential counseling files, so no one else here would have been aware of them. Because of these restrictions, tutor pairings cannot be left to student self-selection — they must be assigned and monitored by me as counselor to ensure we don't inadvertently place students together in violation of those no-contact orders. I'd recommend that the operating requirements specify counselor-assigned pairings rather than student-selected ones."}
```

```json
{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF3", "text": "I need to flag a critical technology issue with the draft plan. Google Classroom is not approved for this program's student-to-student communication. The district-managed Microsoft Teams education environment is the approved platform, and it retains the required school records. I confirmed the platform settings with district IT this week, but the technology field in the draft application still lists Google Classroom and has not been updated. Before Dr. Singh sets the operating requirements, the plan needs to be corrected to specify Microsoft Teams as the communication platform."}
```

